# Local git worktrees nested in the repo (git worktree add .worktrees/<x>). Untracked, but they carry their
# own built .next/, so `eslint .` recursed into them and threw thousands of errors — FOUR PRs carried a "clean
# local lint is impossible" caveat. Ignored here AND in eslint.config.mjs so a local worktree can't break lint.
.worktrees/
